/**
 * Report page showing compliance report with rules and breaches.
// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻renderer🔖renderer🔖pages🔖reportpage🛠️reportpage](composerepo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/renderer.tsx/s/Renderer/s/Pages/s/ReportPage/d/i/ReportPage)
