// #region 🔖Header
// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻main](composerepo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/main.ts)

// 2026 Ueli Saluz <ueli@compose-tech.de>

// This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
