// #region 🔖Sidecar Bridge
// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻main🔖sidecarbridge](composerepo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/main.ts/s/Sidecar%20Bridge)
// Manages the Python sidecar child process over JSON-over-stdio.
