 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elementstsx🔖aggregationcomponents🔖tree🔖controltree🪨defaultcontrolrenderer](composerepo://definition/COMPOSE/JS/SKETCHPAD/ELEMENTS.TSX/AGGREGATION-COMPONENTS/TREE/CONTROL-TREE/DEFAULT-CONTROL-RENDERER)
